{"baseRefName":"main","commits":[{"authoredDate":"2026-07-30T06:56:57Z","authors":[{"email":"ivan@relux.works","id":"U_kgDOBdwbVg","login":"ivanopcode","name":"Ivan Oparin"}],"committedDate":"2026-07-30T06:56:57Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"release: prepare protocol suite v1.0.0-rc.6","oid":"671888e1bd2200ec9774f602c4aeeac3a34bbdaa"},{"authoredDate":"2026-07-31T00:39:40Z","authors":[{"email":"oparin@me.com","id":"U_kgDOBdwbVg","login":"ivanopcode","name":"Ivan Oparin"}],"committedDate":"2026-07-31T00:39:40Z","messageBody":"Managers write install marker schema 2 for every schema 1 through 6\ninstallation mutation, but the shared fixture published only\nexpected/marker.json, the frozen marker-v1 legacy-read evidence. A\ndownstream consumer comparing its own writer output against that file\nsees a schema mismatch it cannot resolve without either rewriting\nrelease history or dropping the writer assertion.\n\nPublish expected/marker-v2.json, generated from the same golden\ninstallation with exactly schema_version, build_roots and builds\nchanged. The golden skill activates no compiled command, so builds is\nempty and build_source stays absent. expected/marker.json is untouched.\n\nThe validator and the rc.6 release gate now require the writer golden,\nreject an in-place edit of the frozen legacy marker, and reject a writer\ngolden that carries build state the fixture has none of, declares\nbuild_source without builds, leaves the schema 1 through 6 range, or\ndescribes a different installation.","messageHeadline":"Publish the marker-v2 writer golden","oid":"0c81c1f8d5321d822be2a2817b05aea03e656e15"},{"authoredDate":"2026-07-31T08:12:41Z","authors":[{"email":"oparin@me.com","id":"U_kgDOBdwbVg","login":"ivanopcode","name":"Ivan Oparin"}],"committedDate":"2026-07-31T08:13:28Z","messageBody":"Move the Go manager pin to fee35c87, whose interop gate reads the\nmanager-lifecycle vector by case name and therefore accepts the rc.6 dry-run\ncase compiled-cache-miss-is-read-only. The previous pin 17804ce required\nexactly two dry-run cases, so Implementations failed on every runner at its\nfirst step. The new pin is the immutable full commit ID of relux-works/curator\nPR 9 and advances to the merged main commit once that PR lands.","messageHeadline":"Advance the Curator implementation pin","oid":"bc83dd13c0d47c4a44acf6e3a226ec297506e60a"},{"authoredDate":"2026-07-31T08:22:42Z","authors":[{"email":"oparin@me.com","id":"U_kgDOBdwbVg","login":"ivanopcode","name":"Ivan Oparin"}],"committedDate":"2026-07-31T08:22:59Z","messageBody":"Move the Go manager pin from fee35c87 to the head of relux-works/curator PR 9,\nbd6ba08, so the pin is the commit that lands. It carries the same lifecycle\ngate plus the toolchain-identity repair that unblocks Curator's own CI, and\nchanges nothing the Implementations job reads.","messageHeadline":"Pin the Curator PR head","oid":"2629aecff19a33e8cd1b5ebcfd898894ff1eeae0"}],"headRefName":"task/BUG-260731-2rhy74-marker-v2-fixture","headRefOid":"2629aecff19a33e8cd1b5ebcfd898894ff1eeae0","isDraft":false,"mergeable":"MERGEABLE","number":15,"reviewDecision":"REVIEW_REQUIRED","state":"OPEN","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-07-31T08:24:08Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/relux-works/curator-spec/actions/runs/30616107892/job/91109553851","name":"Implementations (ubuntu-latest)","startedAt":"2026-07-31T08:23:09Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Implementation conformance"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-07-31T08:23:42Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/relux-works/curator-spec/actions/runs/30616107890/job/91109553385","name":"Specification (ubuntu-latest)","startedAt":"2026-07-31T08:23:09Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Specification CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-07-31T08:26:03Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/relux-works/curator-spec/actions/runs/30616107892/job/91109553952","name":"Implementations (macos-latest)","startedAt":"2026-07-31T08:25:08Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Implementation conformance"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-07-31T08:25:05Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/relux-works/curator-spec/actions/runs/30616107890/job/91109553452","name":"Specification (macos-latest)","startedAt":"2026-07-31T08:24:31Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Specification CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-07-31T08:25:52Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/relux-works/curator-spec/actions/runs/30616107892/job/91109553948","name":"Implementations (windows-latest)","startedAt":"2026-07-31T08:23:26Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Implementation conformance"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-07-31T08:24:33Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/relux-works/curator-spec/actions/runs/30616107890/job/91109553425","name":"Specification (windows-latest)","startedAt":"2026-07-31T08:23:09Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Specification CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-07-31T08:23:13Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/relux-works/curator-spec/actions/runs/30616107890/job/91109553455","name":"Formatting","startedAt":"2026-07-31T08:23:09Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Specification CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-07-31T08:23:13Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/relux-works/curator-spec/actions/runs/30616107890/job/91109553477","name":"Links","startedAt":"2026-07-31T08:23:09Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Specification CI"}],"title":"fix(conformance): publish marker v2 writer golden","url":"https://github.com/relux-works/curator-spec/pull/15"}

